OL,3,APolice given more time to quiz
OL,4,AManchester plot suspects
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Metropolitan
OL,7,FPolice, which is leading the
OL,8,Finvestigation, said their work was
OL,9,F"ongoing and officers continue to
OL,10,Fpursue a number of lines of enquiry".
